Nairobi, Kenya\n+254 20 286 0000\n+254 20 286 1000\n+254 20 286 3000\n+254 709 081 000\n+254 709 083 000\ncomms@centralbank.go.ke\n\n © 2017 Central Bank of Kenya',NULL,0,'{\"chars\": 24218, \"kind\": \"text\", \"label\": \"Pasted source text\", \"ok\": true, \"thin\": false, \"url\": null, \"warnings\": []}','Based on the provided text, for the week starting June 30th to July 7th, 2026, the Central Bank of Kenya (CBK) had one Treasury Bond offering: a June Tap Sale for bonds FXD1-2018-020 and FXD1-2021-025, dated June 29th, 2026. No other offerings are listed within the specified date range.','gemini-2.5-flash',1,NULL,'2026-07-02 23:23:43',1783034625609,570001),(810001,NULL,'6cD924EKpryXuYpd78USGP','James Otieno','I have opened the details under the \"JUNE TAP SALE FXD1-2018-020 AND FXD1-2021-025\" offer. Can you now identify those T bonds on offer for the week','any','done','done','ask',NULL,'pdf','ai-intake/150002/2068017751_JUNE_TAP_SALE_FXD1-2018-020_AND_FXD1-2021-025_DATED_29-06-2026_f88256a4.pdf',NULL,0,'{\"chars\": 1488, \"kind\": \"pdf\", \"label\": \"Uploaded PDF\", \"ok\": true, \"thin\": false, \"url\": null, \"warnings\": [\"Figures were transcribed by AI from an uploaded PDF — confirm each against the original before acting.\"]}','The Central Bank of Kenya offered two Treasury Bonds in a Tap Sale for the week starting June 30th, 2026, specifically FXD1/2018/020 and FXD1/2021/025. The period of sale was from Tuesday, June 23rd, 2026, to Thursday, June 25th, 2026, or until the quantum of Kes 20 Billion was attained. Settlement for successful bids was scheduled for Monday, June 29th, 2026. The bonds have coupon rates of 13.2000% for FXD1/2018/020 and 13.9240% for FXD1/2021/025. The average yields were 13.9885% and 14.8636% respectively, with adjusted average prices of 99.2733 and 96.1351.','gemini-2.5-flash',3,NULL,'2026-07-02 23:25:40',1783034749191,570001),(840001,NULL,'6cD924EKpryXuYpd78USGP','James Otieno','Catalogue review: CBK Securities Reference — TAP SALE OF TREASURY BONDS ISSUE Nos. FXD1/2018/020 AND FXD1/2021/025 DATED 29/06/2026','cbk','done','done','review','cbk','pdf','ai-intake/150002/2068017751_JUNE_TAP_SALE_FXD1-2018-020_AND_FXD1-2021-025_DATED_29-06-2026_47a62b24.pdf','TAP SALE OF TREASURY BONDS ISSUE Nos. FXD1/2018/020 AND FXD1/2021/025 DATED 29/06/2026',0,'{\"chars\": 1488, \"kind\": \"pdf\", \"label\": \"TAP SALE OF TREASURY BONDS ISSUE Nos. FXD1/2018/020 AND FXD1/2021/025 DATED 29/06/2026\", \"ok\": true, \"thin\": false, \"url\": null, \"warnings\": [\"Figures were transcribed by AI from an uploaded PDF — confirm each against the original before acting.\"]}','The Central Bank of Kenya announced a tap sale for two Treasury Bonds: FXD1/2018/020 and FXD1/2021/025, dated June 29, 2026. For FXD1/2018/020, the average yield is 13.9885% and the coupon rate is 13.2000%. For FXD1/2021/025, the average yield is 14.8636% and the coupon rate is 13.9240%. These figures are from the CBK announcement dated June 22, 2026. The source does not provide tenor information for these bonds, nor does it mention any Treasury Bills.','gemini-2.5-flash',2,NULL,'2026-07-02 23:31:32',1783035100001,600001),(870001,NULL,'sample-admin','Admin Person','Capture the EAR for ZZ Ctx MMF 1783036158466.','mmf','done','done','ask',NULL,'text','ZZ Ctx MMF 1783036158466: effective annual rate 16.10% as at Jun 2026.','CIC fact sheet',0,'{\"chars\": 70, \"kind\": \"text\", \"label\": \"CIC fact sheet\", \"ok\": true, \"thin\": false, \"url\": null, \"warnings\": []}','The fund\'s EAR is 16.10%.','test-model',1,NULL,'2026-07-02 23:49:19',1783036160228,630001),(870002,NULL,'sample-admin','Admin Person','Catalogue review: MMF Market — Test fact sheet','mmf','done','done','review','mmf','text','ZZ Review-Only MMF 1783036158481 — Effective annual rate 16.10% as at June 2026.','Test fact sheet',0,'{\"chars\": 80, \"kind\": \"text\", \"label\": \"Test fact sheet\", \"ok\": true, \"thin\": false, \"url\": null, \"warnings\": []}','From the fact